# Notion Integration

## Structure

- `instance.ts`: Client, NOTION_DATABASE_ID
- `getDatabase.ts`: getNotionDatabase (cache + unstable_cache)
- `error.ts`: parseNotionError, ClientError, ServerError
- `utils/notionExtract.ts`: extractText
- `posts.ts`: fetchPosts, fetchPostBySlug

## extractText

- title, rich_text, date 타입 지원
- properties에서 plain_text 추출

## Database Query

- sorts: `{ timestamp: "created_time", direction: "descending" }` 또는 `{ property, direction }`
- getNotionDatabase는 databaseId 없으면 `[]` 반환
